J575d corrective SPMI FIFO recovery register target

The retained v10 FIFO recovery implementation clears the controller FIFO
through the ACT register.  This single functional hunk corrects the inherited
RSP-register target; no normal command, ACK, parity, or payload path changes.

Application: patch --batch --fuzz=0 -p0 from the pinned source root.

--- drivers/spmi/spmi-apple-controller.c
+++ drivers/spmi/spmi-apple-controller.c
@@ -168,5 +168,5 @@ static int spmi_raw_cmd(struct spmi_controller *ctrl, u8 opc, u8 sid,
 	if (spmi->prev_fail) {
-		writel(SPMI_ACT_FIFO_FLUSH, spmi->regs + SPMI_RSP_REG);
+		writel(SPMI_ACT_FIFO_FLUSH, spmi->regs + SPMI_ACT_REG);
 		apple_spmi_irq_ack_raw(spmi, SPMI_IRQ_NOTIFY);
 		spmi->prev_fail = false;
 	}
